          <li>Active in Eta Kappa Nu (IEEE-HKN). Dean's List recipient for academic excellence.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rSection">
      <h2 class="rHead">Technical Skills</h2>
      <div class="skillsGrid">
        <div class="skillRow">
          <span class="skillLabel">Enterprise Platforms</span>
          <div class="skillTags">
            <span>PAM Investment Accounting</span>
